{"abstract":"In this position paper, we discuss about methods currently adopted for research- ing the use of social media in distributed workplace. We have extensively reviewed previ- ous empirical studies through an ongoing Systematic Mapping Study focused on the use of social media in distributed teams; from the review, we realized that research is mainly per- formed through a mix of qualitative and quantitative methods and that each study usually fo- cuses on one specific kind social media at a time. We believe that the social media ecology should be researched as a whole and in relationship with the physical workplace, there- fore ethnographic methods can be adopted to investigate this area. We aim to motivate a debate providing some research questions, which might be addressed by researchers.","author_count":2,"contributors":["Giuffrida, Rosalba","Dittrich, Yvonne"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-384250"],"event":{"end":"2011-09-28","place":"Århus, dk","start":"2011-09-24","title":"European Conference on Computer-Supported Cooperative Work - ECSCW 2011","year":"2011"},"filters":{"added":"2024-06","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"keyword":["Distributed Workplace","Ethnographic research","Qualitative and Quantitative Methods","Social media","Systematic mapping study"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-ITU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-ITU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"social media ecology in distributed workplaces","src":["itu"],"src-code":["DI-U-ITU"],"type":"dcp","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"id":"S01-000.00-384250","ids":["itu-cbdc1fee-d3a6-4f49-8b09-dee2adfa48fa"],"keyword":["Distributed Workplace","Ethnographic Research","Qualitative and Quantitative Methods","Social Media","Systematic Mapping Study"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Local-1-1-40D0F83C524C9DAC7CC2291A9342EA5F"],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"itu it university of copenhagen","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-ITU","l3nl":"IT University of Copenhagen","l3nn":"ITU IT University of Copenhagen","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"ITU IT University of Copenhagen","namevar":["IT University of Copenhagen, Computer Science"],"nora_code":"DI-U-ITU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"","corresponding":null,"first":"Rosalba","key":"giuffridapau","last":"Giuffrida","name":"Giuffrida, Rosalba","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Yvonne","key":"dittrichpau","last":"Dittrich","locid":"f2136570-f73c-446f-9fb0-6d9e461e2124","name":"Dittrich, Yvonne","orcid":"0000-0003-4757-3394","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"publisher":"Springer","status":"p","title":"ECSCW 2011: Proceedings of the 12th European Conference on Computer Supported Cooperative Work"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","IT University of Copenhagen","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["itu-cbdc1fee-d3a6-4f49-8b09-dee2adfa48fa"],"src":["ITU IT University of Copenhagen"],"title":"Social Media Ecology in Distributed Workplaces","type":"Conference Paper","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-384250","year":"2011","yearsub":"2011"}
{"abstract":"We present a PhD project that investigates the use of Social Software (SoSo) in Global Software Development (GSD) teams. Since SoSo in unstructured and informal in its own nature, we explore how informal communication, which is challenging in GSD, is supported by SoSo in distributed teams and how SoSo complements formal tools and documentation.","author_count":2,"contributors":["Giuffrida, Rosalba","Dittrich, Yvonne"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-383740"],"filters":{"added":"2024-06","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"keyword":["Collaboration Tools","Distributed Teams","Global Software Development","Informal Communication","Social Software"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-ITU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-ITU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"exploring the role of social software in global software development projects","src":["itu"],"src-code":["DI-U-ITU"],"type":"dcp","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"un","type":"url","url":"https://www.scopus.com/pages/publications/82855181614","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-383740","identifier":[{"id":"82855181614","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["itu-aa85d2ea-e26e-43f2-871f-30f578c55045"],"keyword":["Collaboration Tools","Distributed Teams","Global Software Development","Informal Communication","Social Software"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-5A17714528EACE679AC9A8DE9B6B0D75"],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"itu it university of copenhagen","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-ITU","l3nl":"IT University of Copenhagen","l3nn":"ITU IT University of Copenhagen","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"ITU IT University of Copenhagen","namevar":["IT University of Copenhagen, Computer Science"],"nora_code":"DI-U-ITU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"","corresponding":null,"first":"Rosalba","key":"giuffridapau","last":"Giuffrida","name":"Giuffrida, Rosalba","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Y.","key":"dittrichpau","last":"Dittrich","locid":"f2136570-f73c-446f-9fb0-6d9e461e2124","name":"Dittrich, Yvonne","name_org":"Dittrich, Y.","orcid":"0000-0003-4757-3394","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"eisbn":["9780769545585"],"isbn":["9781457718397"],"pages":"108-110","publisher":"IEEE","status":"p","title":"Global Software Engineering Workshop (ICGSEW), 2011 Sixth IEEE International Conference on"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-82855181614"],"search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","IT University of Copenhagen","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["itu-aa85d2ea-e26e-43f2-871f-30f578c55045"],"src":["ITU IT University of Copenhagen"],"title":"Exploring the Role of Social Software in Global Software Development Projects","type":"Conference Paper","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-383740","year":"2011","yearsub":"2011"}
{"abstract":"Software is created by people for people working in varied environments, under various conditions. Thus understanding cooperative and human aspects of software development is crucial to comprehend how methods and tools are used, and thereby improve the creation and maintenance of software. Over the years, both researchers and practitioners have recognized the need to study and understand these aspects. Despite recognizing this, researchers in cooperative and human aspects have no clear place to meet and are dispersed in different research conferences and areas. The goal of this workshop is to provide a forum for discussing high quality research on human and cooperative aspects of software engineering. We aim at providing both a meeting place for the growing community and the possibility for researchers interested in joining the field to present their work in progress and get an overview over the field.","author_count":5,"contributors":["Cataldo, Marcelo","de Souza, Cleidson","Dittrich, Yvonne","Hoda, Rashina","Sharp, Helen"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-384983"],"filters":{"added":"2024-06","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"keyword":["cooperative and human factors"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-ITU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-ITU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"workshop on cooperative and human aspects of software engineering chase 000000002011","src":["itu"],"src-code":["DI-U-ITU"],"type":"dcp","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1145/1985793.1986039","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-384983","identifier":[{"id":"79959890853","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["itu-fcb02723-353a-4ad2-ae0f-ed77d857fe3a"],"keyword":["cooperative and human factors"],"lang":"Undetermined","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-F0287538386